{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/What_is_Immortal_Boy.gif?t=1743132998\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNDERTALE</strong> meets <strong>OMORI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a cute retro-fantasy world and battle alongside your companions in this emotionally charged Turn-Based + Bullet Hell RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/Bar.jpg?t=1743132998\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/Gameplay.png?t=1743132998\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wide range of exploration with a plethora of side missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character-rich story with fleshed-out character arcs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minigames for extra rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nostalgic Chiptune Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Windows 98 Webcore Nostalgia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do what <strong>she</strong> says</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/Bar.jpg?t=1743132998\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/Battle_System.png?t=1743132998\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/Health_Worth.gif?t=1743132998\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4-Member Party System in Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special Abilities come at the cost of another character's health (Worth instead of Health)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Bullet-Hell Platforming for Enemy Turn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deal damage by clicking as many times as possible</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/Bar.jpg?t=1743132998\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/Story.png?t=1743132998\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/New_Friends.gif?t=1743132998\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A group of 4 friends race against <u>Tree monsters, Food creatures, Whacky snowmen, Sci-Fi computers, Gambling kings and who-knows-what</u>\u00a0to obtain a magical object that can grant anyone their <strong>Deepest Desire...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, something tells you a <strong>certain friend\u00a0</strong>isn't who they seem...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spanning 9 Chapters (Kinda), Immortal Boy delves into the perspective of a Boy trapped in a psychological prison created by his own self-esteem and self-perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve into Themes of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Insecurity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emotional Manipulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Emotional Attachment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loneliness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relationships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters being stupid for no reason in particular</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/Bar.jpg?t=1743132998\" /></p